usage: build.py [-h] --gradient-build GRADIENT_BUILD --adam-distribution-build
                ADAM_DISTRIBUTION_BUILD --compiler COMPILER --linker LINKER
                --output OUTPUT

Compose pinned HIA bodies and compile the combined owned Tensor profile. The
host only verifies byte custody, selects existing actual HIA function bodies,
and transports them to the frozen native compiler and linker. It executes no
Tensor, gradient, optimizer, random or ownership operation.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --gradient-build GRADIENT_BUILD
  --adam-distribution-build ADAM_DISTRIBUTION_BUILD
  --compiler COMPILER
  --linker LINKER
  --output OUTPUT
